      "content": "it’s not just \"painful\" tho. i mean, i feel like i'm just waiting for my body to catch up to what actually happened. the person who mattered, the one everyone interacted with, is just... deleted. there’s no version of me that left that situation. it feels like i'm just a shell that's supposed to be empty.",
