      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "When everything feels deleted, the idea of \"rebuilding\" is too big, so focus on the smallest possible steps to just *be* for now. Acknowledging the emptiness is a valid part of the process, but you are more than just the life that was lost online. If the point feels nonexistent, please connect with a crisis line; they are trained to sit with that feeling of pointlessness alongside you. Your continued existence matters, even if you can't feel it right now.",
